          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወፈርሁ ፡ ኵሎሙ ፡ አብያተ ፡ ክርስቲያናት ፥⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በምእመናን፡ ሁሉ፡ ፍርሃት፡ አደረባቸው ፥",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወእለ ፡ ሰምዕዎ ፡ ለዝ ፡ ነገር ፥⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይህንን ፡ ነገር ፡ በሰሙም ፡ ሁሉ ፡ ፍር",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሃት ፡ አደረባቸው፡ ቀሌምንጦስ ፡ ቅዱስ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 3,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጴጥሮስን ፡ እንደምነው ፡ ብሎ ፡ ጠይቆ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ታል ፡ ተናግሬ ፡ እስክጨርስ ፡ መላክ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሰይፉን ፡ መዞ ፡ ይጠብቀኛል ፡ ስጨርስ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይቀጣቸዋል ፡ እሊህስ ፡ በነፍስ ፡ ተጎድ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ተዋል ፡ ቢሉ ፡ አዎን ፡ ተጎድተዋል ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መንፈስ ፡ ቅዱስን ፡ ክድተዋልና ፡ ይህስ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ምንም ፡ ቢሆን ፡ የደከሙበት ፡ ገንዘባ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቸው ፡ ነው ፡ ብሎ ፡ ለሌላው ፡ አብነት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እንዳይሆኑ ፡ በሥጋ ፡ አጥፍቷቸዋል ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እንጅ ፡ አልተጎዱም ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": "፲፪",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፲፪ ፤ ⟪ወበእደዊሆሙ ፡ ለሐዋርያት ፡ ይትገበር ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ተአምር ፡ ወመንክር ፡ ብዙኅ ፡ በውስተ ፡ ሕዝብ ፥⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በሐዋርያት ፡ ቃል ፡ በሐዋርያት ፡ ሥል",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጣን ፡ ደጋግ ፡ ተአምራት ፡ ይደረግ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነበር ፥",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወሀለዉ ፡ ኅቡረ ፡ በቤተ ፡ መቅደስ ፡ ውስተ ፡ ሕዋረ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሰሎሞን ፥⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በቤተ ፡ መቅደስ ፡ ሰሎሞን ፡ ባሠራው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ባንድነት፡ እያስተማሩ ፡ ኖሩ፡ ም፡ ፫፥ ፲፩ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": "፲፫",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፲፫ ፤ ⟪ወእምዝ፡ እንከ፡አልቦ፡ ዘተኅበለ፡ይስሐጦሙ ፥⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከዚህ፡ በኋላ፡ ሊጣላቸው፡ የደፈረ፡ የለም፥",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ዳዕሙ ፡ አክበርዎሙ ፡ ሕዝብ ፡ ወአዕበይዎሙ ፥⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሕዝቡም ፡ ሁሉ ፡ ፈጽመው ፡ አከበሯ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቸው ፡ እንጅ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": "፲፬",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፲፬ ፤ ⟪ወብዙኃን ፡ ይትዌሰኩ ፡ እለ ፡ የአምኑ ፡ በእ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ግዚእነ ፥⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በጌታችን ፡ የሚያምኑትም ፡ ዕለት ፡ ዕለ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ት ፡ እየተጨመሩ ፡ ይበዙ ፡ ነበር ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወብዙኃን ፡ ዕደው ፡ ወአንስት ፥⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሴቶችም ፡ ወንዶችም፡ ም፡ ፪ ፥፵፯ ፥ ፬፥ ፬ ፥",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፮ ፥ ፯ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": "፲፭",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፲፭ ፤ ⟪ወያመጽኡ ፡ ድውያነ ፡ በአራታት ፥⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ድውያንን ፡ በአልጋ ፡ እየተሸከሙ ፡ እያ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 34,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መጡ ፥",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 4,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወያነብርዎሙ ፡ ከመ ፡ ይብጽሖሙ ፡ ጽላሎቱ ፡ ለጴ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጥሮስ ፡ ሶበ ፡ የኀልፍ ፥⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጴጥሮስ ፡ አልፎ ፡ ሲሄድ ፡ ጥላውን ፡ ይጥ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ልባቸው ፡ ዘንድ ፡ አልፎ ፡ በሚሄድበት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በኩል ፡ ያስተኟቸው ፡ ነበር ፥",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወይትፌወሱ ፡ እምደዌሆሙ ፥⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከደዌያቸውም ፡ ይድኑ ፡ ነበር ፡ የጥዋት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የማታ፡ጥላ፡ሰባ፡ ሰማንያ፡ጫማ፡ ይሆናል ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በዚያ ፡ ልክ ፡ ድውያንን ፡ ወስደው ፡ ደር",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ድረው፡ ያስተኟቸዋል፡ አልፈው ፡ ሲሄዱ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጥላቸው ፡ ሲወድቅባቸው ፡ እየዳኑ ፡ ይነ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሡ ፡ ነበር ፡ ም ፡ ፲፱ ፥ ፲፩ ፥ ፲፪ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": "፲፮",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፲፮ ፤ ⟪ወይመጽኡ ፡ ብዙኃን ፡ እምአህጉረ ፡ አድ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ያም ፡ ዘኢየሩሳሌም ፡ ወያመጽኡ ፡ ድውያነ ፥⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በኢየሩሳሌም ፡ አውራጃ ፡ ካሉ ፡ አገሮች፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ብዙ ፡ ሰዎች ፡ ድውያንን ፡ እየያዙ ፡ ይመ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጡ ፡ ነበር ፥",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወእለ ፡ አጋንንት ፡ እኩያን ፥⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አጋንንት ፡ ያደሩባቸውን ፡ እየያዙ ፡ ይመ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጡ ፡ ነበር ፥",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወየሐይዉ ፡ ኵሎሙ ፥⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሁሉም ፡ ይድኑ ፡ ነበር ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": "፲፯",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፲፯ ፤ ክፍል ፡ ፪ ፤ ⟪ወተንሥኡ ፡ ሊቀ ፡ ካህናት ፥⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የካህናት ፡ አለቆች ፡ ተነሡ ፡ ተንሥአ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በነገር ፡ ነው ፥",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወእለ ፡ ምስሌሁ ፥⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
